text = "Member of the groups and what they did:

Romain: 
- player logic
- implementation of collectibles
- interface, ui design
- sounds effect implementation
- voice actor 
- game assembly

Rémy:
- enemies logic and pathfinding
- structure logic for the map, collisions and debug
- map creator and assembler

Noémie: 
- creating all sprites
- made all animations
- map and gameplay design
- level designer

List of sprites by Noémie:
- player (dog)
- button keyboard 'e'
- collectibles
- particles

Thanks for everyone who tested the game during
the developement.

Resources used:
Other assets:
House - created by Penzilla Design
Space keyboard - dreammixgames.itch.io
Character in cinematic -
https://craftpix.net/freebies/free-gangster-pixel-character-sprite-sheets-pack/

Menu music - AtlasAudio from Pixabay
Cinematic music - IdoBerg from Pixabay
Game music - jumpingbunny from Pixabay
Game over music - Kuzu from Pixabay"
autowrap_mode = 2

